                                                "sense_id": "29ce8576-2214-3cf0-ba59-4570f13af9e7",
                                                "text": "There the cause of death was soon ascertained ; the victim of this daring outrage had been stabbed to death from ear to ear with a long, sharp instrument, in shape like an antique stiletto, which […] was subsequently found under the cushions of the hansom.[…]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "28b343d1-c1da-3102-b817-b6e80a84212b",
                                        "entry_id": "87622073-4ff3-3d74-adfe-eea05537da74",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An offensive, immoral or indecent act."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dc70b84e-e035-3cc4-90fc-07aceb8163b3",
                                        "entry_id": "87622073-4ff3-3d74-adfe-eea05537da74",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The resentful, indignant, or shocked anger aroused by such acts."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f6d2d24d-805c-390e-856e-8715ecf5948f",
                                        "entry_id": "87622073-4ff3-3d74-adfe-eea05537da74",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A destructive rampage."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "32355ea1-cb39-44a2-b421-e7b775ddea3b",
                                                "sense_id": "f6d2d24d-805c-390e-856e-8715ecf5948f",
                                                "text": "The Lords acknowledge the great and happy Providence of Almighty God, in the preventing of ſo horrid an Outrage, which might have endangered the Lives of the Chief Magiſtrates, and alſo hazarded the Spoil of the whole City of London."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "outrage",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a4085745-56ab-35f9-ae62-e0fdc7295bc6",
                                        "entry_id": "8b9db6f2-9411-39ca-b60a-3b869aa1cc8b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To cause or commit an outrage upon; to treat with violence or abuse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8b1d4c7a-e822-4f06-b613-c42417d6ef3a",
                                                "sense_id": "a4085745-56ab-35f9-ae62-e0fdc7295bc6",
                                                "text": "August 30, 1706, Francis Atterbury, a sermon preach'd in the Cathedral Church of St. Paul, at the funeral of Mr. Tho. Bennet\nBase and insolent minds […] outrage men when they have Hopes of doing it without a Return."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eb53fcb0-3e0c-4520-8758-26d792faf850",
                                                "sense_id": "a4085745-56ab-35f9-ae62-e0fdc7295bc6",
                                                "text": "1725-1726, William Broome, Odyssey\nThe interview […] outrages all the rules of decency."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eeb8d9d9-4567-3b99-87d6-861e4541abb0",
                                        "entry_id": "8b9db6f2-9411-39ca-b60a-3b869aa1cc8b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To inspire feelings of outrage in."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e4f41a09-fd46-40a6-9d10-09738e23ff57",
                                                "sense_id": "eeb8d9d9-4567-3b99-87d6-861e4541abb0",
                                                "text": "The senator's comments outraged the community."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5dbd6ee0-424e-36f8-87a2-ef98a6d3bf44",
